          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "నటన — naṭana — \"acting; a performance\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఆ సినిమాలో ఆమె నటన అద్భుతం. ā sinimālō āme naṭana adbhutaṁ. Her acting in that film is wonderful."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "నటుడు is an actor; నటించు is to act."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "నటన (naṭana) is borrowed from Sanskrit naṭana, \"dancing, dance, pantomime\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
